<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady. Trading was moderate. Top $49.00 lper cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    48.00-48.50</p>
<p>		  270-280 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    46.00-47.00</p>
<p>		  290-300 lbs    45.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - not enough to test the trade.</p>
</text>
